[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Blockquotes
[/meta]

h1. Blockquotes

Tests for Section 12 of the specification.

h2. Bracket Form

h3. Anonymous quote {#quotes-anonymous}
[code om]
[quote]
Anonymous quote.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote>
<p>Anonymous quote.</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. Quote with author {#quotes-author}
[code om]
[quote Oscar Wilde]
Quote with author only.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code html]
<figure class="quote">
<blockquote>
<p>Quote with author only.</p>
</blockquote>
<figcaption>Oscar Wilde</figcaption>
</figure>
[/code]

h3. Quote with source URL {#quotes-url}
[code om]
[quote]:https://example.com/source
Quote with source URL only.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote cite="https://example.com/source">
<p>Quote with source URL only.</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. Quote with author and source URL {#quotes-author-url}
[code om]
[quote Oscar Wilde]:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oscar_Wilde
I can resist everything except temptation.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code html]
<figure class="quote">
<blockquote cite="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oscar_Wilde">
<p>I can resist everything except temptation.</p>
</blockquote>
<figcaption><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oscar_Wilde">Oscar Wilde</a></figcaption>
</figure>
[/code]

h3. Source URL auto-detection {#quotes-url-autodetect}
[code om]
[quote]:www.example.com/source
Text.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote cite="https://www.example.com/source">
<p>Text.</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. Author and auto-detected source URL {#quotes-author-url-autodetect}
[code om]
[quote Someone]:www.example.com
Text.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code html]
<figure class="quote">
<blockquote cite="https://www.example.com">
<p>Text.</p>
</blockquote>
<figcaption><a href="https://www.example.com">Someone</a></figcaption>
</figure>
[/code]

h3. Inline formatting in the author {#quotes-author-formatting}
[code om]
[quote Oscar _Wilde_]
Text.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code html]
<figure class="quote">
<blockquote>
<p>Text.</p>
</blockquote>
<figcaption>Oscar <em>Wilde</em></figcaption>
</figure>
[/code]

h3. Line breaks and paragraphs {#quotes-paragraphs}
[code om]
[quote]
Line one.
Line two.

Second paragraph.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote>
<p>Line one.<br>
Line two.</p>
<p>Second paragraph.</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. Lists and code are allowed {#quotes-list-code}
```om
[quote]
* First
* Second

[code]
x
[/code]
[/quote]
```
[code html]
<blockquote>
<ul>
<li>First</li>
<li>Second</li>
</ul>
<pre><code>x
</code></pre>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. Inline formatting {#quotes-bracket-inline}
[code om]
[quote]
This is *bold* and _italic_.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote>
<p>This is <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em>.</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. Nested bracket quotes are an error {#quotes-nested}
[code om]
[quote]
[quote]
Inner.
[/quote]
[/quote]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. Headings are not allowed {#quotes-heading}
[code om]
[quote]
h2. Heading
[/quote]
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-nesting 2
[/code]

h3. Unclosed quote {#quotes-unclosed}
[code om]
[quote]
Never closed.
[/code]
[code error]
unclosed-block 1
[/code]

h2. Short Form

h3. Single line {#quotes-short-single}
[code om]
> This is a short blockquote.
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote>
<p>This is a short blockquote.</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. Consecutive lines {#quotes-short-multiline}
[code om]
> This is the first line.
> This continues the same blockquote.
> And so does this.
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote>
<p>This is the first line.<br>
This continues the same blockquote.<br>
And so does this.</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. A lone marker separates paragraphs {#quotes-short-paragraphs}
[code om]
> First paragraph of the quote.
>
> Second paragraph of the quote.
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote>
<p>First paragraph of the quote.</p>
<p>Second paragraph of the quote.</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. A line without the marker ends the quote {#quotes-short-termination}
[code om]
> This is quoted.
This is not quoted.
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote>
<p>This is quoted.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This is not quoted.</p>
[/code]

h3. Inline formatting in the short form {#quotes-short-inline}
[code om]
> This is *bold* and _italic_ in a quote.
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote>
<p>This is <strong>bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> in a quote.</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. A marker without a space is a paragraph {#quotes-short-no-space}
[code om]
>text
[/code]
[code html]
<p>&gt;text</p>
[/code]

h3. A list marker inside a short quote is text {#quotes-short-list-marker}
[code om]
> * item
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote>
<p>* item</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. A second quote marker is text {#quotes-short-nested-marker}
[code om]
> > nested
[/code]
[code html]
<blockquote>
<p>&gt; nested</p>
</blockquote>
[/code]

h3. Escaped marker is text {#quotes-short-escaped}
[code om]
\> Not a quote.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>&gt; Not a quote.</p>
[/code]

h3. Mid-line marker is text {#quotes-short-mid-line}
[code om]
a > b
[/code]
[code html]
<p>a &gt; b</p>
[/code]
